.g-config-breadcrumb-container
p.g-delta-acls-config-description.
  These settings control what happens when someone applies a folder's or collection's
  permissions to its subfolders.
form#g-delta-acls-config-form(role="form")
  .form-group
    label.control-label(for="g-delta-acls-default-mode") Default for API clients
    select#g-delta-acls-default-mode.form-control.input-sm
      option(value="replace") Replace subfolder permissions (core behaviour)
      option(value="delta") Apply only the changes
    p.help-block.
      Used when a request asks for recursion but does not say how, as scripts and
      girder_client do. The web interface always says which one the user chose.
  .checkbox
    label
      input#g-delta-acls-replace-admin-only(type="checkbox")
      | Only site administrators may replace subfolder permissions
  p#g-delta-acls-config-error.g-validation-failed-message
  input.btn.btn-sm.btn-primary(type="submit", value="Save")
